{"generated": "2026-10-03 03:56", "brief": "<b>1. 최태원 SK그룹 회장의 지분 매각과 경영권 방어</b>\n최태원 SK그룹 회장이 노소영 아트센터 나비 관장과의 이혼소송 재산분할에 대비해 약 9,440억 원 규모의 SK㈜ 지분 일부 매각을 추진합니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE9GMXgxS2RLODlDSGt3cHlZYkF1dFRtUndUREdTQ1ZnUEhfSmcwcW9rTlh2WTdfaFBzSDZ5YndRT1hfWEkxNkRuZFhLbnZrX2NBYmV6QU5RaTZZRktDMUxpVDRuUk41VjZES1EzOHN0X2lIczh6OUxqeVFaVQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#5</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZ0FVX3lxTE9wVGNkcFBGTVJVSnlObUdSMjhlNXVEVkJDUFJNamdqcThmb2NhZ1JlLTh2Q2lxNzJTLVBrQVdESk53ZWZsWUVlck53ZGF5RXRoNVAxQVpZZkhaRUZEZEVGc0w2TDV5Znc?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#32</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE1HLWFXVXpObmdUaFRDV0JFdHJkVHRFOGRvUjFxUEplUE44OVQ4akJDUE5FNUtjeDdBNnNCYlN3M3o1cjdBdDI5RzdEcUJpMTQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#34</a>]. 이번 매각은 대규모 현금 마련과 동시에 SK㈜가 보유한 24.8%의 자사주를 방패 삼아 지배구조 안정성을 유지하려는 포석으로 풀이됩니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE9GMXgxS2RLODlDSGt3cHlZYkF1dFRtUndUREdTQ1ZnUEhfSmcwcW9rTlh2WTdfaFBzSDZ5YndRT1hfWEkxNkRuZFhLbnZrX2NBYmV6QU5RaTZZRktDMUxpVDRuUk41VjZES1EzOHN0X2lIczh6OUxqeVFaVQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#5</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE4zNFkyZlRMSDEwVHFiREQ4NncyUXlNTXZPMXFxMmpQWmFfUFllZ21KSTJNeEN5S3VGdFFfOUxCMzkyMWRBQ2JncElBeFpTdmw5VjNYX2JHVG5CRThiMklJQlJvVkhFQW1Jd3c?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#20</a>].\n\n<b>2. SK하이닉스 자회사 솔리다임의 미국 상장 추진 논란</b>\nSK하이닉스가 자회사 솔리다임의 미국 증시 상장을 추진하면서 국내 투자자들 사이에서 중복상장에 따른 주주가치 훼손 우려가 제기되고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE9sNFlQdlg0MEI4c05vdGt0aVhoYlBxLTcxQTRUQWVtRDk4dFVwbHpaekM0UEJIMjlhTnNjOVR6ckd6X1paMUY2Mm1OYkRIUklKOEFUWkpQX3JSTGw5anhvTHJCdmRXSWxLSzYzMnpR?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTFBMbThkNHhHVXpmMXFOUTRjTUhIRmN4N0F3ZmpReWI4YVdKeHBabzRDekFsbkszanl6cEVnLTNyeTRvUEY3Rm5OejVPLWcw